{
  "_about": "Design tokens for Adniro live chat. Adniro's own palette (teal #0d9488 on Bootstrap 5.3), written as roles. Light values first, dark values under color.dark. The live copy is the :root block of public/assets/css/chat.css. Check with: python3 contrast.py replica/design/tokens.json",
  "color": {
